RetinaPriority Gemma 4 LoRA

This directory contains a modified, derived artifact based on
google/gemma-4-26B-A4B-it at revision
4d7ae4984b7db7de8f8457170b3f1a419ee76d52.
It is a RetinaReady research artifact and is not an official Google model.

Changes made by RetinaReady contributors in 2026:

- trained a q_proj/v_proj rank-16 LoRA on public DeepDRiD-derived manifests;
- selected the step-60 adapter on the frozen validation split; and
- converted the selected adapter to an F32 GGUF with llama.cpp b10180 at
  commit 11b068d06605288ce7917534b46d52b47823dc13.

The Gemma base weights are not included in this repository. Full provenance,
hashes, evaluation boundaries, and limitations are recorded in manifest.json
and the repository documentation.

